# Elastic Load Balancing Gateway Load Balancers

> Use Gateway Load Balancers to deploy, scale, and manage virtual appliances, such as firewalls, intrusion detection and prevention systems, and deep packet inspection systems.

- [What is a Gateway Load Balancer?](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/introduction.md)
- [Getting started](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/getting-started.md)
- [Getting started using the CLI](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/getting-started-cli.md)
- [Quotas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/quotas-limits.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/doc-history.md)

## [Gateway Load Balancers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/gateway-load-balancers.md)

- [Create a load balancer](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/create-load-balancer.md): Learn how to create a Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Update the IP address type](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/load-balancer-ip-address-type.md): Learn how to update the IP address type for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Edit load balancer attributes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/edit-load-balancer-attributes.md): Learn how to edit load balancer attributes for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Tag a load balancer](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/tag-load-balancer.md): Learn how to update the tags for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Delete a load balancer](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/delete-load-balancer.md): Learn how to delete your Gateway Load Balancer.

### [LCU reservations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/capacity-unit-reservation.md)

Learn about Load Balancer Capacity Unit Reservation for your Gateway Load Balancer

- [Request reservation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/request-capacity-unit-reservation.md): Before you use LCU reservation, review the following:
- [Update or terminate reservation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/update-capacity-unit-reservation.md)
- [Monitor reservation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/monitor-capacity-unit-reservation.md)


## [Listeners](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/gateway-listeners.md)

- [Update listener target group](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/update-target-group.md): Learn how to update the target group for your Gateway Load Balancer listener.
- [Update idle timeout](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/update-idle-timeout.md): Learn how to Update the TCP idle timeout for your Gateway Load Balancer.


## [Target groups](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/target-groups.md)

- [Create a target group](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/create-target-group.md): Learn how to create a target group for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Configure health checks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/health-checks.md): Learn how to configure the health check settings for your target groups.
- [Edit target group attributes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/edit-target-group-attributes.md): Learn how to edit target group attributes for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Register targets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/target-group-register-targets.md): Learn how to add or remove targets from a target group for your Gateway Load Balancer.
- [Tag a target group](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/target-group-tags.md): Learn how to update the tags for your target groups.
- [Delete a target group](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/gateway/delete-target-group.md): Learn how to delete a target group for your Gateway Load Balancer.


